<title>USA: Pengo may buy more Inland Resources shrs.</title>
<headline>Pengo may buy more Inland Resources shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inland Resources Inc said Monday that Pengo Securities Corp, the company's largest shareholder, has informed the company that it may acquire additional shares of the Inland common stock through open market purchases.</p>
<p>Pengo currently holds a 59 percent stake in Inland.</p>
</text>
